We can take the agg_crud as one service and make the "reviewdB" as new service as follows

Create a second Spring Boot project in IntelliJ named review-service.

Select these dependencies:
- Spring Web
- Spring Data MongoDB
- Lombok
Use the base package com.example.reviewservice.

